{"2431740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Couch Planes", "steam_appid": 2431740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/2f243a43931574d238e9987e0cd1b824.poster.avif?t=1783536340\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/2f243a43931574d238e9987e0cd1b824.webm?t=1783536340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/2f243a43931574d238e9987e0cd1b824.mp4?t=1783536340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race the skies to glory in Couch Planes, an airborne party game where the craftiest pilot wins. Tight flying meets over-the-top fun in this fast-paced joyride. Whether you’re dodging missiles with friends on the couch or gunning for the leaderboard glory online, you’ll feel the thrill of being an arcade stick jockey. Zip through hazard-filled maps, collecting race-changing power-ups, on your way towards the finish line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/ef9d2ebdcc740a101309d25c6e0820e8.webp?t=1783536340\" width=1170 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/837252c67d1961d1055b2067d31d1908.poster.avif?t=1783536340\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/837252c67d1961d1055b2067d31d1908.webm?t=1783536340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/837252c67d1961d1055b2067d31d1908.mp4?t=1783536340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly solo, squad up, or turn game night into a friendly competition to see who is master of the skies. Couch Planes supports local 4-player split-screen and up to 12 players online, with support for mixing local and online pilots. Take it casual or get sweaty and dominate with precision flying. Either way, it’s all systems go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/b8d023383d8cde15a1922f92882aa564.webp?t=1783536340\" width=1170 height=60 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/cb3eb72fc733de4b596a3c2a5d5f4a85.poster.avif?t=1783536340\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/cb3eb72fc733de4b596a3c2a5d5f4a85.webm?t=1783536340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/cb3eb72fc733de4b596a3c2a5d5f4a85.mp4?t=1783536340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However you like to fly, there’s a mode to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/c88c671cb677bb3c67c8052a54991d5c.webp?t=1783536340\" width=1170 height=60 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/a807787878a22bfd6c86737e8b6bc0bb.poster.avif?t=1783536340\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/a807787878a22bfd6c86737e8b6bc0bb.webm?t=1783536340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/a807787878a22bfd6c86737e8b6bc0bb.mp4?t=1783536340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash mid-air balloons to unleash game-changing power-ups: homing rockets, speed boosts, exploding mines, and more. Items are balanced by your position, so no one’s ever too far ahead–or safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/702bbe0b984fa304da45cdb55d2d358b.webp?t=1783536340\" width=1170 height=60 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/872f008375b6347d192061aded65f451.poster.avif?t=1783536340\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/872f008375b6347d192061aded65f451.webm?t=1783536340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/872f008375b6347d192061aded65f451.mp4?t=1783536340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly across 15 handcrafted maps full of environmental hazards and goodies, from tornadoes and collapsing cliffs to power-up windmills and treasure-hauling steam trains. Thread the needle to take a shortcut, but misjudge and you’ll be tasting your friend’s afterburners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/a1e9ff14408c52e58a6950387fef1040.webp?t=1783536340\" width=1170 height=60 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/5aec62a5778ca8be79bf0cf56392e1dc.poster.avif?t=1783536340\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/5aec62a5778ca8be79bf0cf56392e1dc.webm?t=1783536340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/5aec62a5778ca8be79bf0cf56392e1dc.mp4?t=1783536340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, arcade controls make it easy to jump in, but there’s plenty of depth under the hood. Learn to barrel roll past missiles, drift through tight turns, or flip your way out of trouble like a skyborne stunt master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/7773b862dd953a6689cd0dedf52c0044.webp?t=1783536340\" width=1170 height=60 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/fcad153a036942ed0b1bb905413219de.poster.avif?t=1783536340\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/fcad153a036942ed0b1bb905413219de.webm?t=1783536340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/fcad153a036942ed0b1bb905413219de.mp4?t=1783536340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress while you play to earn cosmetics, including skins, trails, decals, and effects. And none of it affects performance. There’s no pay-to-win nonsense here. Everyone competes on equal footing, but only the best look good doing it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/973cdf6d82ae09bda9567d1cf5a252aa.webp?t=1783536340\" width=1170 height=60 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/358a32bcf9650ae625830d88292cab10.poster.avif?t=1783536340\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/358a32bcf9650ae625830d88292cab10.webm?t=1783536340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/358a32bcf9650ae625830d88292cab10.mp4?t=1783536340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With seasonal events, rotating shop items, ranked ladders, and evolving content, Couch Planes is always cooking up something new. Whether you're in for a quick match or chasing your next unlock, there’s always a reason to jump back into the cockpit.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/2f243a43931574d238e9987e0cd1b824.poster.avif?t=1783536340\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/2f243a43931574d238e9987e0cd1b824.webm?t=1783536340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/2f243a43931574d238e9987e0cd1b824.mp4?t=1783536340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race the skies to glory in Couch Planes, an airborne party game where the craftiest pilot wins. Tight flying meets over-the-top fun in this fast-paced joyride. Whether you’re dodging missiles with friends on the couch or gunning for the leaderboard glory online, you’ll feel the thrill of being an arcade stick jockey. Zip through hazard-filled maps, collecting race-changing power-ups, on your way towards the finish line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/ef9d2ebdcc740a101309d25c6e0820e8.webp?t=1783536340\" width=1170 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/837252c67d1961d1055b2067d31d1908.poster.avif?t=1783536340\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass