andcrafted maps full of environmental hazards and goodies, from tornadoes and collapsing cliffs to power-up windmills and treasure-hauling steam trains. Thread the needle to take a shortcut, but misjudge and you’ll be tasting your friend’s afterburners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/a1e9ff14408c52e58a6950387fef1040.webp?t=1783536340\" width=1170 height=60 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/5aec62a5778ca8be79bf0cf56392e1dc.poster.avif?t=1783536340\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/5aec62a5778ca8be79bf0cf56392e1dc.webm?t=1783536340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/5aec62a5778ca8be79bf0cf56392e1dc.mp4?t=1783536340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, arcade controls make it easy to jump in, but there’s plenty of depth under the hood. Learn to barrel roll past missiles, drift through tight turns, or flip your way out of trouble like a skyborne stunt master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/7773b862dd953a6689cd0dedf52c0044.webp?t=1783536340\" width=1170 height=60 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/fcad153a036942ed0b1bb905413219de.poster.avif?t=1783536340\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/fcad153a036942ed0b1bb905413219de.webm?t=1783536340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/fcad153a036942ed0b1bb905413219de.mp4?t=1783536340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress while you play to earn cosmetics, including skins, trails, decals, and effects. And none of it affects performance. There’s no pay-to-win nonsense here. Everyone competes on equal footing, but only the best look good doing it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/973cdf6d82ae09bda9567d1cf5a252aa.webp?t=1783536340\" width=1170 height=60 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/358a32bcf9650ae625830d88292cab10.poster.avif?t=1783536340\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/358a32bcf9650ae625830d88292cab10.webm?t=1783536340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/extras/358a32bcf9650ae625830d88292cab10.mp4?t=1783536340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With seasonal events, rotating shop items, ranked ladders, and evolving content, Couch Planes is always cooking up something new. Whether you're in for a quick match or chasing your next unlock, there’s always a reason to jump back into the cockpit.</p>", "short_description": "Couch Planes is a fast-paced airborne party game where the craftiest pilot wins. Dodge missiles, grab power-ups, and race through hazard-filled maps in various game modes in chaotic local or online matches. Easy to learn, wild to master, always a blast.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German, French, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/13650108c258f24eccb84bb130fe69a97a4498a6/header.jpg?t=1783536340", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/bacf1f6e25bc1119ba1c1d792a7f9a37aa46b5c8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783536340", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2431740/bacf1f6e25bc1119ba1c1d792a7f9a37aa46b5c8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783536340", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit version 1703<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i3-3225 3.3 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 4000; AMD Radeon Vega 8<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i5-7300U 3.5 GHz, AMD Ryzen 3 3300U, or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 960, AMD R9 280, or equivalent DX11 GPU<br></li><l